{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33795","headline":"太湖诗 桃花坞 · 皮日休","name":"太湖诗 桃花坞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夤缘度南岭，尽日穿林樾。\n穷深到兹坞，逸兴转超忽。\n坞名虽然在，不见桃花发。\n恐是武陵溪，自闭仙日月。\n倚峰小精舍，当岭残耕垡。\n将洞任回环，把云恣披拂。\n闲禽啼叫窱，险狖眠硉矹。\n微风吹重岚，碧埃轻勃勃。\n清阴减鹤睡，秀色治人渴。\n敲竹鬬铮摐，弄泉争咽嗢。\n空斋蒸柏叶，野饭调石髪。\n空羡坞中人，终身无履韤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33795.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33795","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}